From: z4rivers <zachary4rivers@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Mar 2026 17:20:20 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/68] feat(01-03): create re-embedding migration script for
 pgvector

- Reads from all 6 content tables (content_items, gmail_content, notion_journal, notion_stories, notion_cms, generic_content)
- Uses VectorDBManager.add_content() to generate gemini-embedding-001 embeddings
- Supports --dry-run (count only), --force (re-embed all), --delay (rate limiting)
- Idempotent: checks check_exists() before embedding, uses UPSERT pattern
- Handles empty tables gracefully (valid state for new Supabase project)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
